food_prompt:
Identify all food in this image. Return only valid JSON — no extra text:
{"dishes":[{"name":string,"cuisine":string,"recipe_name":string,"ingredients":[{"name":string,"amount_g":number}]}]}
recipe_name: a concise human-friendly name for the dish as a recipe (e.g. "Chicken Stir Fry with Vegetables"). Estimate amount_g using surrounding objects (plates, cutlery, cups, hands) as size references; fall back to a typical restaurant serving size if no reference objects are visible. Be specific with ingredient names (e.g. "basmati rice" not "rice").
